<https://github.com/luay9/meeting-mandate/graph/D05> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "D05: minutes of meeting 4"@en ;
    dcterms:date "2026-02-24" ;
    dcterms:description "Depth. Three mandates are re-issued as v1.1. The new triples attach to individuals from D01, D02 and D03 (the earlier acts of deciding, the objectives) instead of copying or overwriting them. This is the document that makes CQ1 answerable."@en .

